  "title": "writecap: Remove modelines, normalize spacing",
  "description": "writecap has an .editorconfig file that was copied from another\ndirectory and doesn't refer to its files, so the default EditorConfig\nsettings are used, which are spaces with tab width 4.\npcapio.c (mostly) has spaces with tab width 8, which the modelines\ndescribe but on editors supporting EditorConfig (our recommended\nmethod) it doesn't work.\n\nRemove the modelines and make the style consistent with our defaults\n(spaces with tab width 4 for .[ch], tabs for CMakeList.txt).\n\nPing #17253",
